{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49051","headline":"奉和郎中题仙岩瀑布十四韵 · 灵澈","name":"奉和郎中题仙岩瀑布十四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"致闲在一郡，民安已三年。\n每怀贞士心，孙许犹差肩。\n采异百代後，得之古人前。\n扪险路坱圠，临深闻潺湲。\n上有千岁树，下飞百丈泉。\n清谷长雷雨，丹青凝霜烟。\n遥将大壑近，闇与方壶连。\n白石颜色寒，老藤花叶鲜。\n轩皇自兹去，乔木空依然。\n碧山东极海，明月高昇天。\n平野生竹柏，虽远地不偏。\n永愿酬国恩，自将布金田。\n穆穆早朝人，英英丹陛贤。\n谁思沧洲意，方欲涉臣川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}